        <section class="mb-4">
            <h2>5. Monthly Subscription</h2>
            
            <h3>5.1 Subscription Features</h3>
            <p>
                By subscribing to our monthly subscription service, you gain unlimited streaming access to all songs in our library 
                for the duration of your active subscription. The subscription price is displayed at the time of subscription and 
                may be subject to change with advance notice.
            </p>

            <h3>5.2 Free Trial Offers</h3>
            <p>
                A subscription may include a free trial when that offer is displayed to you at enrollment. Your eligibility,
                the length of the trial, and the recurring price that begins after the trial will be shown before you approve
                the subscription. Free trials are generally limited to eligible first-time subscribers; returning subscribers
                receive the currently offered paid plan unless a different offer is explicitly displayed to them.
            </p>
            <p>
                A free trial provides the same full streaming access as a paid subscription. Unless you cancel before the trial ends,
                the subscription automatically converts to the displayed recurring monthly price. If you cancel during the trial,
                you will not be charged the first recurring payment and will retain full access through the trial end date confirmed
                by your subscription provider.
            </p>

            <h3>5.3 Billing</h3>
            <p>
                Subscriptions are billed monthly through our payment processor on a recurring basis. Your subscription will automatically renew 
                each month unless you cancel it. By subscribing, you authorize our payment processor to charge your payment method at the beginning 
                of each billing period according to their terms of service.
            </p>

            <h3>5.4 Cancellation</h3>
            <p>
                You may cancel your subscription at any time through your account management page. When you cancel:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>You will be asked to confirm your cancellation</li>
                <li>Your subscription will remain active until the end of your current paid billing period or free trial</li>
                <li>You will continue to have full access to all songs until your subscription end date</li>
                <li>You will not be charged for any subsequent billing periods</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                After your subscription end date, you will only be able to preview the first 60 seconds of songs.
            </p>

            <h3>5.5 No Refunds</h3>
            <p>
                All completed subscription payments are final. We do not offer refunds for subscription fees. Canceling an eligible
                free trial before it ends prevents the first recurring payment as described above. We encourage you to use the
                60-second preview feature before subscribing.
            </p>
        </section>

