            </p>
            <p>
                Streamtunes may issue required tax reporting forms, including IRS Forms 1099-NEC, as required by law.
            </p>
            <p>
                All rates, examples, and payout references are stated in gross amounts before any applicable taxes, withholdings, processor fees, currency conversion fees, or legally required deductions.
            </p>

            <h3>10.7 Independent Contractor Relationship</h3>
            <p>
