                <li>The song is immediately removed from the platform and no longer available for streaming</li>
                <li>The song files are deleted from storage</li>
                <li>The song is removed from playlists, recommendations, and search results</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                Deletion of a song does not affect the creator's right to receive unpaid stream-based earnings accrued prior to deletion, subject to the minimum payout threshold, compliance requirements, and applicable law.
            </p>

            <h3>10.9 Creator Account Closure or Deactivation</h3>
