        <section class="mb-4">
            <h2>11. Tipping Policy</h2>
            <p>
                StreamTunes allows listeners to send voluntary tips to music creators as a way to show appreciation 
                for their work. Tips are processed through PayPal and are subject to the following terms:
            </p>
            <h3>Tip Amounts and Limits</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Tips must be between $1.00 and $50.00 USD per transaction</li>
                <li>Users are limited to 5 tips per hour</li>
                <li>Users are limited to 10 total tips to the same creator</li>
                <li>Users must have an account that is at least 7 days old to send tips</li>
                <li>Creators cannot tip themselves</li>
            </ul>
            <h3>Tip Processing and Payouts</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Tips are held for a minimum of 7 days after receipt before being eligible for payout to the creator</li>
                <li>After the hold period, tips are included in the creator's next scheduled payout batch</li>
                <li>Tips are paid between 8 and 14 days after they are submitted</li>
                <li>Tips are non-refundable once paid to the creator</li>
            </ul>
            <h3>Fraud Prevention</h3>
            <p>
                StreamTunes employs fraud detection measures including IP address tracking and device fingerprinting 
                to prevent abuse of the tipping system. We reserve the right to withhold, delay, or reverse tips 
                if we suspect fraudulent activity. Users engaging in suspicious tipping patterns may have their 
                tipping privileges suspended or their accounts terminated.
            </p>
            <h3>Tip States</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Pending:</strong> Tip received, within the mandatory hold period</li>
                <li><strong>Cleared:</strong> Hold period passed, eligible for the next payout</li>
                <li><strong>Paid:</strong> Tip has been included in a payout to the creator</li>
                <li><strong>Refunded:</strong> Tip returned to the tipper</li>
                <li><strong>Chargeback:</strong> PayPal chargeback received</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

